  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "scene": "s0",
      "beat": "b-title",
      "text": "参赛作品：智串AI · TUNER，\nAI 串口调试助手。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-001.wav",
      "dur": 5.328,
      "start": 0.6,
      "end": 6.178
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "scene": "s0",
      "beat": "b-title",
      "text": "面向电赛、智能车、RC 与 RM 的\n赛前调参加速器。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-002.wav",
      "dur": 5.544,
      "start": 6.528,
      "end": 12.322
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "scene": "s0",
      "beat": "b-team",
      "text": "团队「咕电子队」，三名本科生协作完成。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-003.wav",
      "dur": 4.008,
      "start": 12.672,
      "end": 16.93
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "scene": "s0",
      "beat": "b-team",
      "text": "刘双瑞：队长、路演负责人，\n负责后端算法。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-004.wav",
      "dur": 4.584,
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 22.114
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "scene": "s0",
      "beat": "b-team",
      "text": "吴程龙秀：技术主管、前端；\n胡雨杨：产品经理、调研与 PPT。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-005.wav",
      "dur": 6.696,
      "start": 22.464,
      "end": 29.41
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-origin",
      "text": "创意始于调研：20 多款串口调试工具，\n没有一款支持 AI。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-006.wav",
      "dur": 5.712,
      "start": 30.26,
      "end": 36.222
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-quotes",
      "text": "有队员说：手动调参只能调个大概，\n经常被压力，变成背锅侠。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-007.wav",
      "dur": 6.216,
      "start": 36.572,
      "end": 43.038
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-quotes",
      "text": "也有人说：怕没用，\n更怕 AI 乱调把机械弄坏。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-008.wav",
      "dur": 4.752,
      "start": 43.388,
      "end": 48.39
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-quotes",
      "text": "还有人希望，告诉我现象\n对应什么参数问题、该怎么调。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-009.wav",
      "dur": 5.208,
      "start": 48.74,
      "end": 54.198
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-survey",
      "text": "7 份问卷：100% 说试错最耗时，\n42.9% 单次调参超过三天。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-010.wav",
      "dur": 7.488,
      "start": 54.548,
      "end": 62.286
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-survey",
      "text": "57.1% 赛场离线刚需，85.7% 愿赛前试用，\n71.4% 要 AI 建议加人工确认。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-011.wav",
      "dur": 9.864,
      "start": 62.636,
      "end": 72.75
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "scene": "s1",
      "beat": "b-origin",
      "text": "所以先打通数据链路，\n再让 AI 在护栏内动手。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-012.wav",
      "dur": 4.968,
      "start": 73.1,
      "end": 78.318
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "scene": "s2",
      "beat": "b-timeline",
      "text": "6 月 29 日技术选型，7 月底波形、\n分析与仿真护栏陆续跑通。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-013.wav",
      "dur": 6.192,
      "start": 79.168,
      "end": 85.61
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "scene": "s2",
      "beat": "b-review",
      "text": "8 月 1 日中期评审：\n要真实测评，要想清怎么推广。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-014.wav",
      "dur": 5.112,
      "start": 85.96,
      "end": 91.322
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "scene": "s2",
      "beat": "b-review",
      "text": "回应：7 问卷扩到 12 深访、25 人扩测，\n5 条反馈全部闭环。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-015.wav",
      "dur": 6.384,
      "start": 91.672,
      "end": 98.306
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "scene": "s2",
      "beat": "b-timeline",
      "text": "8 月 7 日调研 AI Harness 后，\n决定重构为对话式智能体。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-016.wav",
      "dur": 5.208,
      "start": 98.656,
      "end": 104.114
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "scene": "s2",
      "beat": "b-timeline",
      "text": "8 月 25 日 Agent 上线，\nv1.1.0 安装包发布。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-017.wav",
      "dur": 5.088,
      "start": 104.464,
      "end": 109.802
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "scene": "s2",
      "beat": "b-deliver",
      "text": "四阶段可运行交付：28 个源文件、\n8422 行代码、51 张验证波形。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-018.wav",
      "dur": 7.584,
      "start": 110.152,
      "end": 117.986
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "scene": "s3",
      "beat": "b-panorama",
      "text": "一个工作台：波形、分析、数据、\n调参都在一处。",
      "wav": "assets/voice/seg-019.wav",
      "dur": 5.328,
      "start": 118.836,
      "end": 124.414
